<!--
  ImapNotesX adaptive-icon foreground layer (API 26+).
  Vector mirror of art/icons/imapnotesx_master.svg / imapnotesx_foreground.svg -
  keep them in sync. Regenerate the legacy PNG fallbacks with
  `python3 scripts/make_icons.py`.
-->
